   ("States of matter", ["<b>Solid</b> — fixed shape and volume; particles closely packed, vibrating about fixed positions.", "<b>Liquid</b> — fixed volume but takes the shape of its container; particles close but able to slide.", "<b>Gas</b> — no fixed shape or volume; particles far apart and moving rapidly and randomly. Changes: melting, freezing, evaporation, condensation, sublimation."]),
