   ("Common examples", ["Elements: metals (iron, copper, sodium), non-metals (oxygen, carbon, sulphur). Compounds: water (H₂O), carbon dioxide (CO₂), common salt (NaCl), lime (CaO). Mixtures: air, sea water, brass, petroleum."]),
